  "description": "A young man finds himself consumed by an irresistible attraction—to his best friend's mother. With a face that defies age, a body sculpted to perfection, and a dangerously seductive aura, she stirs desires he can no longer ignore. From glimpses of lace peeking through to the teasing sway of her hips, every encounter fuels his fantasies. But when he asks her for private yoga lessons, will he be able to keep his composure… or will temptation push them both past the point of no return?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
